# A cubic spline closed into a periodic one, by clicking its first point
# again while the spline tool is still placing points; the same request
# a script makes with Entity.MakePeriodic.
key b
move 150 300
down L 150 300
up L 150 300
move 250 200
down L 250 200
up L 250 200
move 350 400
down L 350 400
up L 350 400
move 450 300
down L 450 300
up L 450 300
move 150 300
down L 150 300
up L 150 300
key esc
save
